window.products.push({"id":390010,"name":"Wireless Meat Thermometer Smart Meat Thermometer for Grilling and Smoking Bluetooth 260ft Range Digital APP Control Cooking Thermometer for Oven/Grill","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":98.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81N3-G1uMSL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"265FT SUPER LONG RANGE: The wireless thermometer for grilling is inserted in the meats for the entire cooking process, then the app of bluetooth meat thermometer monitors the food temps remotely as it slowly goes up and gives an alarm when they’re done. It is truly wireless smart meat thermometer and can monitor temp from 10ft(inside) up to 260ft(outside),make your cooking be wireless and freedom. UPGRADE MEAT THERMOMETER WITH REPEATER: Unlike other's thermometers, our upgraded thermometers include a repeater. Even in a closed cooking environment, the Smart phone can receive signals normally. The repeater can also charge the thermometer(charged for 20 mins and worked up 36 hrs). You can charge the thermometer anytime and anywhere even when you are outdoors, without changing the battery frequently, saving time and cost of buying the battery. MULTI PROBE DESIGN: Our dual probe wireless thermometer can cook two kinds of food at the same time, such as steak, turkey, fish, pork, etc. Wireless Thermometer supports 1 probe/2 probes/4 probes. If you have more thermometers, you can cook more food at the same time. Our packing instructions will walks you through every step of the cooking process to guarantee perfect and consistent results. You can also set up custom alerts / notifications based on temperature and/or time. EASY TO USE & CARRY: The wireless thermometer for grilling comes with built-in 9 recipes, like beef, veal, lamb, and chicken. You can also add a new menu for customizing the temperature and receive alerts from the bluetooth meat thermometer. The package includes a handbag, which is convenient for you to take anywhere and cook anywhere. EASY TO COOKING: Monitor your cook using the FREE app available for iOS (10.3 and later) / Android (5.0 and later) smart phones and tablets. Turn on your mobile phone Bluetooth, take out the needle, turn on the repeater (signal receiver), and turn on the App to set the cooking mode you want. Insert the needle into the steak, put it into the oven, and wait for the mobile phone alarm /notifications. You can also set up custom alerts / notifications based on temperature and/or time.Christmas, Thanksgiving gifts","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81N3-G1uMSL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XiaYchaug","source_asin":"B0C36JKDSL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-390010","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C36JKDSL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C36JKDSL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
