window.products.push({"id":390056,"name":"MICOOLS Queen Mattress,10 Inch Deluxe Comfort Memory Foam Mattress,CertiPUR-US, Multi-Layered Foam,Supporting Body Weight,Comfort and Relieve Pressure","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91kaZwAQ3RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【MATERIAL & CONSTRUCTION】:Micools 10 inch queen mattress dimensions: .To improve support and heat dissipation,Micools 10 inch Cooling-Gel Memory Foam Mattress is designed with three layers all-foam system. To improve support and heat dissipation，mattress include 2” memory foam, 1” comfortable layer, and 5” high density base support foam for ultimate comfort. 【HIGH-QUALITY FOAM】:Queen mattresses are covered by good-quality knitted fabrics and multiple layers of hign quality memory foam which is ventilated and breathable.All memory foams are certified by CertiPUR-US. Better choice for family. 【COMFORTABLE AND BREATHABLE SLEEP】:Ultra-breathable, dual knitted fabric covers keep you cool throughout the night. Furthermore, breathable comfort foams and fireproof layer also act as deeper routes for air to flow out of the mattress. You’ll enjoy a safer, cooler and less-sweating night’s sleep. 【MATTRESS IN A BOX】:This mattress is efficiently compressed into one box that’s easily shipped and maneuvered into the bedroom; simply unbox, unroll, and this mattress does the rest, expanding to its original shape within 72 hours 【WORRY-FREE WARRANTY】:Micools free for 10 years limited warranty against manufacturer defects.Twin mattress supports a maximum weight of 250 lbs,while all other sizes can support up to 500 lbs.With our professional customer service team, we help deal with any dissatisfaction problems. If for any reason you are unsatisfied, contact us at any time for support.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91kaZwAQ3RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MICOOLS","source_asin":"B0BFDSFBRV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-390056","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFDSFBRV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFDSFBRV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":390057,"name":"SKINNY TUMBLERS (12 pack) Matte Pastel Colored Acrylic Tumblers with Lids and Straws | 16oz Double Wall Plastic Tumblers With FREE Straw Cleaner! Reus","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DScJeiGEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅COLD DRINKS STAY COLD! And warm drinks stay warm! Forget about single-walled tumblers. Sure, they can hold a drink, but sooner or later you’ll wish that cold drink hadn’t gone warm, or left condensation rings all over your surface. Strata Tumblers with their double walls, thermo-regulate your drinks so you can enjoy them down to the last refreshing drop. ✅12 CHIC MATTE BLACK CUPS: When you’ve got a personality this vibrant, you need a sassy, colorful tumbler to match. Show off your free-wheeling spirit and playful vibes with the CUTEST acrylic tumblers on Amazon. Each set includes twelve tumblers with lids and straws, so you'll have plenty to grab from when you forget one in your car's cupholder. ✅SPLASH-PROOF LIDS: Most acrylic tumblers come with a rubber push down lid, and when you drop them the lid pops off. Strata Tumblers come with colored screw top lids with tight straw seal. While we can’t say a few drops won’t escape, we can say you won’t be cleaning up a giant orange juice mess from your carpet. ✅EASY TO CLEAN: Cracked plastic and water getting into the double walls are real concerns when it comes to cleaning an acrylic tumbler. So our design team solved both problems. Your tumblers are 100% Handwash Only. They also come with a BONUS STRAW CLEANER so you can keep straws spotless inside and out. ✅SATISFYING TO GRIP: Many people agree skinny tumblers are the most comfortable size to hold. Not only do they feel good, they’re easier for kids, and folks with arthritic hands. Each tumbler is 8.5” high with a 2.5” diameter, and holds 16oz of your favorite beverage. BPA FREE, Non-Toxic.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DScJeiGEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"STRATA CUPS","source_asin":"B08L8GV742","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-390057","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L8GV742","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L8GV742","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
