window.products.push({"id":390141,"name":"International Concepts 18-Inch Round Top Stool, Unfinished","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.46,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fihH-eV1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Offer a warm, inviting look to your kitchen, dining room, bar, or lounge with this solid wood barstool from International Concepts. This beautifully crafted stool is part of a high-quality collection of wood furniture that boosts a traditional and elegant look that will easily complement any décor. Parawood – a hardwood known for its durable, strong, and environmentally friendly nature – is used to craft this attractive and durable stool. Pair with one of the wide variety of solid wood tables from International Concepts and create the perfect gathering place in your home!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fihH-eV1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"International Concepts","source_asin":"B08749G22B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-390141","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08749G22B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08749G22B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":390142,"name":"VAHDAM, Glow Loose-Leaf Gift Set & Infuser Trio (2 Infuser & 1 TeaSpoon) - Premium Teas with Loose-leaf infusers |Stainless Steel Pyramid Tea Infuser,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512N9yHMTuL._SL1000_.jpg","description":"OPRAH'S FAVORITE THINGS - Vahdam Teas has been featured in the prestigious Holiday Gift Guide curated by Oprah Winfrey for 2 consecutive years now. This a perfect Holiday Gifts for Women. This Tea Gifts set can be a perfect Mom Gifts, Grandma Gifts, Teacher Gifts & Birthday Gifts for Women. Perfect Gifts for her. 3 PIECE TEA MAKER SET - 1 Square Tea Infuser, 1 Triangle Tea Infuser & 1 Perfect Serve Tea Spoon. Everything you need to make the Perfect Cup of Loose Leaf Tea. HIGHEST Quality Green Tea Infuser, loose leaf tea infuser, iced tea infuser, black tea infuser, white tea infuser, loose tea infuser, herbal tea infuser, stainless steel infuser, tea infuser, sweet tea infuser, leaf infuser, chai tea infuser, leaf tea infuser, tea infuser set, infuser tea, tea infusers, oolong tea infuser CARBON & PLASTIC NEUTRAL BRAND - Established in India by a 28-year-old 4th generation entrepreneur, we are now proud to be a certified Carbon-Neutral & a Plastic-Neutral brand. We measure our overall carbon and plastic footprint & offset it via our investments in environment sustainability initiatives in India. A BRAND WITH A BILLION DREAMS - Established in India by a 26-year-old, 4th generation Tea entrepreneur, Vahdam Teas is an award-winning, vertically integrated tea brand that door delivers the world's freshest tea leaves to over 83 countries, sourced directly from India's choicest tea gardens. The tea industry is one of the largest employers of manual labor in India. A successful home-grown brand helps empower millions of these tea workers in the long run. ETHICAL, DIRECT & FAIR-TRADE- TRULY - Our innovative supply chain model ensures you get the freshest cup of tea and our farmers get a better price for their produce. 1% of our revenue is redirected towards the education of our tea growers' children. Our farmers, like any other parent, wish for their progeny to have a better life than them. We at Vahdam Teas with our social initiative, TEAch Me, simply wish to honor this aspiration.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512N9yHMTuL._SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VAHDAM","source_asin":"B08L41ZQ42","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-390142","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L41ZQ42","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L41ZQ42","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
