window.products.push({"id":390184,"name":"Small Rectangle Foot Stool, PU Leather Fabric Footrest Small Ottoman Stool with Non-Skid Plastic Legs, Modern Rectangle Footrest Small Step Stool Otto","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lvc5+QlvS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Comfortable Footstool ---- The small footstool raises your feet to take pressure off of your back and hips, provides you with overall better posture. Correct posture not only helps you feel better when sitting at your desk all day, but it also makes you look better when on video/ conference calls. The footstool and ottoman padded with high quality thick and high density sponge, more comfortable and soft than ordinary footstool. Perfect Small Size for Resting --- This 9” high small footstool ottoman is perfect for feet. It’s not a large ottoman for using as a cocktail table. This footrest small ottoman stool is compact enough to keep near your couch, under chair or even under a desk. The rectangle footrest is a space saver, can be moved around as needed, perfect fit for our small apartment. Soft & Stable & Anti-Slip --- The covering of the padded ottoman stool is made of PU material, the surface is skin-friendly and comfy. The little footstool’s frame is made of solid wood material plus and hold it with sturdy plastic legs. It also comes with anti-skid floor protecting pads. Various Applications Footrest --- The lightweight footstool is simple, sleek design matching almost any interior design style. Can be used in multiple rooms unlike a bulky and heavy ottoman. Use for under your desk to elevate your feet, also works great while sitting on the couch. This step stool ottoman also provides a step for dogs or cats to get up onto the bed or couch. Easy to Assemble & Good Service --- The small footstool for chair is very easy to assemble. The plastic feet, screws and washers come stored in a well designed zippered compartment underneath. It's a cute little pocket and a fun place to hide or store items. If you have any problem, please be free to contact us, we will try our best to help you solve it within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lvc5+QlvS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LUE BONA","source_asin":"B09ZP5BH1T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-390184","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZP5BH1T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZP5BH1T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
