window.products.push({"id":390348,"name":"Thermalogic 70370-188-80-84-103 Curtain Panel, 40\" x 84\", Natural, 2 Piece","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.47,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51aoo2xIVdL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This Collection by Thermalogic® is wonderfully suitable for the homeowner wanting their windows designed with style and thermal efficiency. This Collection features a cotton duck fabric versatile in style, created to reduce light and complement your room's decor. The double-layer-backing on this room-darkening curtain insulates against temperature variations, blocks some light, grants you privacy, provides UV protection, and dampens sound. Thermalogic® room-darkening curtains are specially insulated to cut down on energy consumption costs by reducing drafts, trapping the warmth, and keeping out the cold air during the winter. In the summer, these room-darkening curtains are very energy efficient. They block summer sunlight, insulate the windows, and prevent the inside air from warming, thus decreasing air conditioning. Thermalogic's® insulating properties also muffle noise from outside, which is especially useful for those working unusual hours and needing uninterrupted sleep. This collection provides ample protection by blocking harmful UV rays, which can fade your floors and damage your furniture. When properly installed, Thermalogic® room-darkening curtains will significantly block most incoming light. They will be keeping your sleeping space comfortably dim, and these curtains promote a more gradual waking experience without the harsh glare of morning light. Moreover, you will benefit from the day and nighttime privacy created by these curtains. They suppress light from outdoor sources while still enabling you to see well enough to navigate a room. The antique brass-colored metal grommets in the header make these curtains simple to install and will easily glide open and close. Pair this collection with your favorite decorative curtain rod up to 1 5/8\" in diameter, and you will find it drapes beautifully with even and precise pleats. This Collection features a firmly woven canvas-style fabric with a beautiful drape and texture, designed to harmonize with any decor style. The curtain's face is made with a 100% soft cotton duck that is long-lasting and easy to clean. It's also resistant to wrinkles because of the fabric's weight and the tightness of the canvas weave. The backing is composed of a white 100% acrylic material of durable quality. Simply machine wash in cold water on a gentle cycle and hang to dry. Whatever you do, do not dry clean it. These curtain panels come in a 40\", easy-to-install width ideal for skinnier windows and are generally considered more economical. They make it easier to buy just the right number of panels needed to achieve the look you desire without having expensive excess material. That usually happens when purchasing full-width curtains. For an elegant look and to achieve proper fullness, incorporate multiple panels that measure 1.5-2 times the width of your window in total. Remember by extending your rod an extra 6-8 inches on either side. It gives the illusion of a wider window. This technique also minimizes unfiltered light from leaking in through the sides. The 84-inch length is best suited for rooms where you either need the curtain a few inches off the floor or are dealing with lower ceilings. Decorator's Tip: An excellent way to make low ceilings feel higher and your room look larger is installing your curtain and rod to the ceiling. It will also minimize the amount of light that will seep through the top of your window. All Thermalogic® products pass through a rigorous inspection process. We ensure that our curtain panels match in length, that hemlines are smooth, and patterns flow correctly. Our quality materials are dye fast, contain no defects, and will last for years to come.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51aoo2xIVdL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Commonwealth","source_asin":"B002VH2OFY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-390348","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002VH2OFY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002VH2OFY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
