window.products.push({"id":390390,"name":"Beaded String Natural Bamboo Wood Beaded Curtain-90 Strands -78 in (6.5 ft) High-Boho Door Beads-Bohemian Doorway Curtain-Sunrise","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":74.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1tcfvWf+gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This beautiful bamboo beaded door curtain is made of 90 strands, about 1/4\" apart. Each bamboo bead is individually hand painted to produce this artistic image which is seen from both sides.  Add a twist to an ordinary space with this beautiful Hand Painted Bamboo Beaded Curtain. A bamboo beaded curtain is an easy and affordable way to add colour, character and style to your space.  You can hang your door beads over a door panel to disguise the clutter or you can use them as window curtain, closet curtain, partition or wall decoration.  You can use a beaded curtain as door beads, you don't have to remove an existing door, just hang the door beads over an existing door. They will look fabulous.  You can also use a bamboo beaded curtain to cover or beautify a doorway or a gateway or even as your closet curtain.  A bamboo beaded curtain can also be used as an wall art. They are gorgeous and truly a piece of art.  Last but not least, a beaded curtain can be used as a window treatment to add a twist to a boring window!   Installation is super easy. Bamboo bead curtains are very easy to install and can be simply relocated from one place to another. Each curtain comes with two hooks attached to the wood rod. See last image. NOTE: Beaded curtains regardless of their type or the number of the strands cannot provide 100% privacy, especially if the light is coming from both sides of the curtain. To provide some privacy light should be off on that side of the curtain.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1tcfvWf+gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaded String","source_asin":"B079GB12NZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-390390","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079GB12NZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079GB12NZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":390391,"name":"MOPALL Small Garbage Can with Lid - 3 Gallon Bathroom Trash Can,with Auto-Adsorption Function,11 Liter Compact Trash Bin with Press Type Lid,for Offic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jjBkdU90L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"ADSORPTION TRASH BAGS FUCTION🥇When the lid is closed by hand, the indicator light will be on and start to absorb the garbage bag. Through the air outlet and air inlet. The garbage bag inside the garbage can will cling to the wall of the can. This feature is designed to solve the problem of static electricity or air causing less space available inside the bin, so you don't have to use your hands to adjust the ttrash bags MORE HYGIENIC&BLOCKS SMELLS💨The lid of the can is removable, making it easy to dispose of waste without any mess.If you're looking for a bin that won't smell like baby diapers or have trouble tolerating the smell of trash, this bin is definitely the way to go. DOG-PROOF TRASH CAN🐶The lid of the small trash can is heavier and it is impossible for your pet to crack.So whether it's in the bathroom, bedroom or office, this trash can be the perfect addition to any place if you have pets and small children. 3 GALLON TRASH CAN WITH LID🧡This is a trash can with a press-on lid, the perfect solution for your bathroom waste management needs. This compact and stylish can is designed to fit easily into any bathroom space, without compromising on functionality or style.It is also one of the perfect choices for office and bedroom.Dimension: 12.99 \"L x 6.35 \"W x 11.81 \"H.Package contains bucket body, bucket lid, Buckle, a roll of garbage bags, USB charging cable (Type-C port) EASY USE AND CLEAN💎The sleek and modern design of this small trash can with a lid adds a touch of elegance to your bathroom decor. The can is made from high-quality, durable materials that ensure it will last for a long time. The exterior of the can is coated with a smooth finish, making it easy to clean and maintain. Important Note📕: Whether open the cover or close it, just gently press the cover with your hand, do not pull it.the sound of pressing the bucket lid is like the sound of clicking a mouse.it is worth noting that this bathroom wastebasket only has an auto- adsorption function, and is not touchless.using type-c charging, it can be used for at least 3 months on a single charge.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jjBkdU90L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MOPALL","source_asin":"B0BQ2LRBZ4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-390391","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQ2LRBZ4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQ2LRBZ4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
