window.products.push({"id":390405,"name":"JOZON Easter Gnome Window Clings Decorations for Glass Window 9 Sheets Happy Easter Gnome Bunny Easter Eggs Carrot Window Stickers Decals Decor for Ea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811FtDhBtRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These cute window clings will make your windows look great in this easter. Hope you enjoy your time to decorate your windows with your friends and families. Specifications: - Material: Electrostatic membrane PVC - Quantity: 9 sheets easter gnome window clings - Size: Each sheets measures 11.8 inch x 7.8 inch - Easy to use for any smooth surface, stick it all by themselves, good stickiness for a long time. - Reusable and durable for next year use. - NO CLUE, NO TAPE, NO MESS. Clear and Vibrant Colors Clear and vibrant print colors on these Easter elements like Easter gnome, bunny, bunny ears, easter eggs, carrot, happy easter words, flowers will definitely add courful feelings to your house. Surprise your families or friends with this happy easter gnome window decal from trendy window designs! Double Sides Prints These lovely easter gnome window decals, are double-side printed, so you can see the image from both sides of the window, look so adorable on the windows or glass door, your families will be happy with the window clings and can't move eyes from them. Large Easter Window Clings Each sheets measures 11.8 inch X 7.8 inch, them can be clearly seen on the window no matter from inside or outside. How to use? 1. Make sure the surface is smooth and without any texture. Or the air will into the gap between the clings and surface then make the clings fall off. 2. Clean the surface to make sure there is no dust and grease on the surface. 3. Spray a little water on the surface. Water will make them stick better. 4. Put the clings on and remove the remaining water. Keep in mind these stickers are non-adhesive! These won't stick to most walls unless the finish is very glossy. Package Includes: 9 Sheets of Easter Gnome Window Clings","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811FtDhBtRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JOZON","source_asin":"B08SWBSSVP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-390405","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SWBSSVP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SWBSSVP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
