window.products.push({"id":390669,"name":"Momiji Premium Reusable Grocery Shopping Bags, Unique European Artists, Certified Recycled Polyester, Set of 1 Bag, Foldable, Eco-Friendly, Machine Wa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uJGplPXOL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"Momiji Polyester Reusable Shopping Bags - Adorable and Eco-Friendly The only foldable shopping bags made from certified recycled polyester Does anyone really like plastic bags? They're small, bland, rip under weight, and are a strain on the environment. But now you can break free from plastic with Momiji's reusable shopping bag . Made with strong recycled polyester, our reusable grocery bag set measures 19.7 inches by 15.7 inches each and can hold up to 55 pounds without tearing or threatening the integrity of the craftsmanship. When you want to put it away, it folds down to an amazing compact size of 5.9 by 5.5 inches - small enough to fit into your your pocket, purse, handbag, or glove compartment . We've also collaborated with an incredible artist to give our foldable bags for groceries a glamorous , fun look aesthetic. You'll love the way your grocery shopping tote bag looks, and you'll have a peace of mind knowing that you're helping the environment by cutting back on wasteful plastic bags. Your order comes with one grocery tote bag in luxurious packaging. There's no need for additional gift wrap when giving these shopping tote bag set as presents. So make the responsible choice and switch to Momiji reusable totes today! About Katja Ollendorff 'I am inspired by so many pattern-lovers before me. In every decade patterns bring joy, no matter the state of the world around us. It’s hard not to feel hopeful when you look at patterns. That’s why I can’t stop creating them for everything from tiny children’s clothes to huge neighbourhood murals. If you are a pattern lover, you are a friend of mine.' Product Details (1) Grocery Shopping Bag with Handle Bag Size (Unfolded, with Handles): 19.7 in. x 15.7 in. Materials: Polyester Colors/Designs: birds dark blue background Washing Instructions: Machine wash below 113 degrees Fahrenheit","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uJGplPXOL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Momiji","source_asin":"B08G53JVSD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-390669","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08G53JVSD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08G53JVSD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
