window.products.push({"id":390830,"name":"Geeignet Inspirational Wall Art Family Signs Canvas Painting Farmhouse Motivational Love Pictures Home Decor for Bathroom Bedroom Living Room 12x12 In","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811K2+ZlHkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Geeignet Decor, a heart-warming saying, an elegant design, make a loving team. Lots of laughs and lots of love are a great way to spend a day as a family. Use the home sign wall decor help you set the tone for these types of moments everyday! Perfect for your living room, bedroom, bahtroom or any wall in your home, each design work has been carefully crafted by professional designers, bring laughter, touch and love to your family. Product Details: Each step of our canvas wall art from design, print quality, sewing and packaging to the production process is strictly monitored. Print Quality: High-end canvas materials and imported ink printing, eco-friendly, waterproof and fading resistant indoor, the prints are highly restored to the color of the design, and the color remains lasting； Sewing: Canvas stretched and wrapped extends over the solid wood frame, a metal hook already mounted on the wooden bar, ready to hang, each side of the wooden bars is sealed with white tapes to beautify the looking of the wall art. Packing: Each paintings is packed in a carton, which contains instructions and installation accessories. Light up your life: You can decorate anywhere in your home according to your preferences, Also, our artwork is a great gifts for family and friends at Wedding, Anniversary,  Thanksgiving, Christmas, Mother's Day, Father's Day, Valentine, Birthday and others.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811K2+ZlHkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FVLFIL","source_asin":"B0855D1C77","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-390830","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0855D1C77","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0855D1C77","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":390831,"name":"Eco-Dri Towels, Quick-Drying Bath Towels, Bathroom Towels, Bath Towel Set, Spa Towels, Absorbent Bath Towels, Hand Towels, Bath Towels","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91npjHQ5jcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ECO-DRI BATH TOWELS: Ultra plush and luxurious, these big, fluffy bath towels are ultra soft. They are spa-quality and lush, for the ultimate in softness and indulgence. Eco-Dri towels are made using naturally derived volcanic minerals that attract and release moisture for maximum absorption and breathable freshness. REMARKABLY FRESH: Thanks to Eco-Dri Technology, our large, premium towels are noticeably fresher than most because of our unique mineral technology. Our towels capture odors and release them in the laundering process, so they're fresher out of the washer. Eco-Dri towels also dry quickly, which means they stay fresh longer. WASHCLOTHS, HAND TOWELS & BATH TOWELS: Eco-Dri towels come in two-piece and six-piece sets. With either high-quality set, you will never confuse these oversized bath towels with towels bought in a bulk pack. They offer premium freshness backed by our technology and come in designer colors to complement the most refined decorative tastes. EASY CARE FOR YEARS OF USE: Eco-Dri towels absorb odors and release them during the laundry process, which means you'll smell only freshness. To care for Eco-Dri towels and ensure years of quality use and enjoyment, never use bleach, and wash Eco-Dri towels with like colors. Tumble dry on low/medium heat. OEKO-TEX CERTIFIED: The freshness and absorbency of Eco-Dri towels are completely safe and free from harmful chemicals. Oeko-Tex certification goes a few steps further than the strict guidelines needed for organic certification. Intricate product details like the dye, thread, and other materials must meet exacting standards to qualify for Oeko-Tex certification.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91npjHQ5jcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eco-Dri","source_asin":"B0854NM3KT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-390831","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0854NM3KT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0854NM3KT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
