window.products.push({"id":390890,"name":"Caleca Zafferano 16-Piece Dinnerware Set, Service for 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41776T0E9SL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Solarity of the Caleca pattern Zafferano reflects a scattering of delicate small powder-blue flowers, the strong presence of the typical Caleca yellow distributes itself in the delicate decoration and in its light brushed-stroked rays. Amazon.com Manufactured and decorated by hand in Sicily for over 200 years, this Italian pottery from Caleca maintains a high level of durability, beauty, and tradition. Individually constructed and painted by hand, each piece receives a stamp ensuring its authenticity. With or without the official seal, the brightly saturated colors and whimsically fresh patterns are instantly recognizable as Caleca designs. Four 11-inch dinner plates, four 8-1/2-inch shallow bowls, four 8-1/4 inch salad plates, and four 12-ounce mugs make up the Zafferano 16-piece dinnerware set from Caleca. From the Italian for saffron, the Zafferano pattern showcases fresh saffron yellow serving areas surrounded by bands of brilliant blue and creamy yellow. Wildflowers in shades of blue decorate the edge of each piece in the collection. Crafted from lead-free, non-toxic clay, all Caleca dinnerware is chip-resistant and can safely be placed in the dishwasher and microwave. --Lea Werbel What's in the Box 4 place settings. Each place setting consists of: 11-inch dinner plate; 8-1/2-inch shallow bowl; 8-1/4-inch salad plate; 12-ounce mug. 16 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41776T0E9SL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Caleca","source_asin":"B000246BOI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-390890","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000246BOI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000246BOI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":390891,"name":"De'Longhi FBA_613742 EDG657T Nescafe Dolce Gusto Esperta 2 Espresso and Cappuccino Machine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+zbp0k7nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Make the perfect morning cup of coffee with the Nescafe Dolce Gusto Esparto 2 single serve Coffee maker and espresso machine. This patented smart capsule system, exclusively for Nescafe Dolce Gusto capsules, is a professional-grade pressure based system that extracts and squeezes more flavor, aroma and body from the Coffee and produces a thick, rich, velvety cream. With our hermetically sealed capsules, which preserve Coffee freshness, you'll enjoy rich aromatic Cups every time. The user friendly interface with adjustable features make it the perfect go-to morning cup maker and offers the optimal Coffee making experience. This Coffee machine boasts numerous State of the art features - a new wheel interface and a flow-stop system with an 8 level LED display that helps control beverage size and strength, so you can customize the Drink's flavor The way you want it. It has a thermos block heating system that controls and balances the coffee's temperature to keep its freshly brewed flavor. No preheating is required. The 15 bar automatic pressure regulator helps produce custom Coffee and frothy milk, so you can create an aromatic cup of Coffee filled with aroma, flavor and warmth. The esparto's dishwasher safe drip tray is height adjustable, so you can fill any size cup or glass directly from the spout. The 120-volt Coffee maker has an energy saving automatic stand-by mode that switches off after being idle for five minutes. Pop a pod of Nescafe Dolce Gusto and create a hot cup of cappuccino, or if you prefer, make a tall glass of hot or iced coffee, or a specialty Coffee or tea of your choice from our 30 different Coffee creations. Either way, the Nescafe Dolce Gusto genio single serve Coffee maker will satisfy the needs of any morning coffee drinker, as well as the desires of any Coffee enthusiasts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+zbp0k7nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"De'Longhi","source_asin":"B074XYN82Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-390891","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074XYN82Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074XYN82Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
