window.products.push({"id":390988,"name":"4th of July Patriotic Decorations Porch Sign Banners, Home of the Free Because of the Brave Hanging Flag Decor with Stars and Stripes for Independence","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kaBXyF0OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Decorating your house with beautiful patriotic banners at these patriotic seasons is always a cool thing to do. It definitely shows your love for this great country and your respect for those brave veterans who have fought for this country on the filed. Get yours today and make your house and porch speak for your love and respect for the brave ones. Unique Features of KECEMUY Patriotic Decorations Sign: ● Shows Your Love & Respect Proudly The independence day decorations banners read “Home of the Free” and “Because of the Brave” in big fonts in vivid patriotic blue and white colors, and have Stars and Stripes on the top to feature the national flag. ● Unpack & Use, No Assembly, No Tools Needed. The memorial day decor signs come in all assembled. Just unpack it and hang them up. ● Ideal Size, Easily Noticeable The patriotic decor banner flag is 12.6”X71” in size, which is large enough to be noticeable and fits all around in the house. ● STURDY, Built to Last, for Indoor & Outdoor It’s made of weather resistant oxford 600D fabric and has 2 metal grommets at the bottom to attach weight so it won’t get blown away when using outside. What’s Included in the Package: 1x “Home of the Free” Sign 1x “Because of the Brave” Sign","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kaBXyF0OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KECEMUY","source_asin":"B0B3NH6BKV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-390988","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3NH6BKV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3NH6BKV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":390989,"name":"GE Osmonics (94587) Hytrex 9-7/8\"x2.5\" GX05-9 7/8 Spun Polypropylene Depth Sediment 5 Micron Filter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.41,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01d7lyKVVyL._AC_.jpg","description":"Features and BenefitsThe Hytrex depth filter is an exceptional value for general applications where long life, high purity and low change-out frequency are required. Produced through GE's patented melt blown microfiber technology, Hytrex is a 100% pure polypropylene depth filter with exceptional dirt-holding capacity. Hytrex true-graded density filter matrix (lower density at the surface of the filter with progressively higher density toward the center) captures particles throughout the entire filter depth. This translates to longer life and fewer change-outs than existing string wound or resin-bonded filters.Hytrex contains no wetting agents, solvents, antistatic agents or binders, and meets the requirements of the FDA for food and beverage contact. The filter incinerates to trace ash for easy disposal.Applications Potable water filtration Chemical filtration - wide chemical compatibility Plating baths Amine filtration Meets FDA compliance for food and beverage contactMaterials of Construction Filtration Media : Polypropylene End caps and Adapters : PolypropyleneDimensions Nominal O.D. - 2.50\" (6.4 cm) Nominal I.D. -1\" (2.5 cm) Length - 9-7/8\"Additional Information Hytrex Depth cartridge filters are made from thermally bonded fibers of polypropylene. GE certifies that it uses no resin binders, lubricants, antistatic or release agents or other additives in the manufacture of these cartridges, and that the resin used for manufacturing the filter media meets the food contact requirements of the U.S. FDA 21 CFR regulations. When required, specify only FDA complain sealing materials and end adapters. GE filter cartridges are designed and manufactured for resistance to a wide range of chemical solutions. Conditions will vary with each application and users should carefully verify chemical compatibility. Please contact your GE distributor for more information.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01d7lyKVVyL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Osmonics","source_asin":"B015DNSSI4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-390989","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B015DNSSI4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B015DNSSI4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
